    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 3,
        "name": "avg_npc_648_1#3$1",
        "style": "cutin",
        "fadestyle": "horiz_expand_center",
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "offsetx": -300,
        "width": 200,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Feist! The safe house in Highbury is under attack!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Catherine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's the situation over there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#6$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're mounting a counter attack and are evacuating underground. The situation's dire. It's likely that the Sarkaz have...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Catherine"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is not a simple annihilation. They are planning to...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Catherine"
    },
    {
        "text": "...must...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Catherine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$transmission",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 3,
        "fadetime": 0.2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Granny? Granny, do you hear me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "text": "Drat, the transmission's cut off!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's going on? We have three safe houses under attack by the Sarkaz!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "text": "Their communications have been cut off. We must back them up immediate\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_401_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, it's not just the three safe houses.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia"
    },
    {
        "text": "<i>Our</i> communications have been cut off.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Get down, Doctor!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
