        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Clovisia, what's going on?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "How can this be? Here...? This place is top-secret within the Self-Salvation Corps!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_401_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Logos mentioned to me that it's possible the Sarkaz have infiltrated our intelligence network.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Based on the situation we now find ourselves in, I can only assume that the failure of our confidentiality far exceeds what we anticipated.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_401_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's very likely that all Self-Salvation Corps bases are under attack.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "We must evacuate!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_401_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_401_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where can we go, though...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
