        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_235",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The mid-level buffer zone has been breached, too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misery"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, the enemy is using a new Sarkaz witchcraft device. With their numbers and strength... Our Defense Forces and Self-Salvation Corps friends won't be able to withstand this assault.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misery"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Truth be told, we have no chance of winning. Robben, who's in charge of organizing defense, won't last very long.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_401_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "How much time can they buy us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fifteen minutes... No, half an hour.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's all the time we have.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_401_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Evacuate? Where are we supposed to run? There isn't anywhere safe for the Self-Salvation Corps to go in Londinium!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_401_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The equipment factory's third warehouse? The carpark at the Four Seasons Department Store? Maybe Viscount Byrne's mansion...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_401_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, they're all too risky.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_401_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "There has to be somewhere else...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_401_1#9$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "If it's dangerous everywhere in Londinium, we can evacuate the city for the time being.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_401_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Evacuate Londinium?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_401_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_411_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right! The Sarkaz supply line!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "text": "We can use the supply line in Highbury and get the hell out of Londinium!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've got too many wounded men and non-combatants. Taking an underground route will help us avoid most of the fighting!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But all our work in Londinium...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The onslaught we are facing tells us that they simply thought they had no need to wipe us out before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now that war has broken out, the Military Commission has started to truly see the Self-Salvation Corps as a threat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_explo_n",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 50,
        "ystrength": 50,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_crowdrun",
        "volume": 0.8
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We have no time to hesitate.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "I need to head out immediately to back Robben up. We will try to draw the Sarkaz main force's attention the best we can to cover your evacuation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_401_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Very well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_401_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, Doctor. The Self-Salvation Corps will need your assistance in this evacuation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#21$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We will never abandon our allies.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Ascalon, mount a breakout.;Misery, destroy all files.",
        "values": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_395_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Understood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_235",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am on it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misery"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Logos.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Help Horn and her team buy us time.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rest assured, Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will guarantee your safety.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "text": "Before we could finalize plans to relocate and secure our communications... The Royal Court picked the perfect time for this annihilation operation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "It seems they know us better than we ever imagined.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_650_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Theresis has also gotten sharper... not like when he was simply pretending.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "text": "If it's certain that this place will fall, I guess... it won't matter if we go all out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Logos, we will be back!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can rebuild this place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_401_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Next, we need to find the entrance to the Highbury supply route.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Feist, this is where you come in.;Rockrock, you know the underground passages better than anyone.",
        "values": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Understood. Everyone, come with me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rest assured, I will evacuate safely with the wounded.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Closure, take all the wounded and non-combatants and go with them.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "I'm counting on you and Shining to take care of Kal'tsit.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_411_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wha? Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_411_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, Dr. {@nickname}, what kind of sick joke is this?! If I'm supposed to be a non-combatant, then so are you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "text": "You bet your ass I can beat the crap out of you! It's <i>you</i> who should be evacuating with the rest of them!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_411_1#11$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Amiya and Ascalon will make sure I will be safe.;We will hold the Sarkaz pursuers. This is the safest way.",
        "values": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#21$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor... I won't let you get hurt.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_411_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tsk, crafty dipshit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_411_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, we've got three teams.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "text": "Horn, Misery, and Logos will lead the primary operation to resist the Sarkaz assault. Doctor, you go with Amiya and Siege's gang to hold the other Sarkaz pursuers.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shining and I will follow the rest of the Self-Salvation Corps and evacuate this place without making any noise.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where are we gonna meet up in the end?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#19$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The small town outside Londinium... Brentwood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_411_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, objective confirmed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#19$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're now in war.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "It won't spare any one of us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#17$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But we also... mustn't lose hope.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
